{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113129","id":3041469394,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc61SSPS","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113129.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113129/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113129/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113129/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/86faf9c529e9d6370a901c25dc81416027babc97","number":113129,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Update Blender importer to handle more Vertex Color options","user":{"login":"TheSofox","id":3089525,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwODk1MjU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3089525?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox","html_url":"https://github.com/TheSofox","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TheSofox/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes #97953 \r\n\r\nOn Blender 4.2, Blender changed its export options for Vertex Color from `export_colors` that was a true/false variable to `export_vertex_color` which is an enum with multiple values. This PR matches updates the Godot interface to better access these options, namely `MATERIAL`, `ACTIVE` and `NONE`\r\n\r\n<img width=\"435\" height=\"267\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7edc503e-221b-4d18-8e87-7186b83f365d\" />\r\n\r\nFor compatibility, if a boolean is read from a `.import` config file, it is processed by `handle_compatibility_options` where a `false` is mapped to `NONE` and a `true` is mapped to `MATERIAL`\r\n\r\nIf a person uses a Blender version prior to 4.2, then selecting `NONE` will send `export_colors` a `false` value and any other option will send a `true` value.\r\n\r\n`MATERIAL` is default for fresh models. According to https://docs.blender.org/api/current/bpy.ops.export_scene.html , this will \"Export vertex color when used by material.\"","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666708289,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA4Mjg5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:3d","name":"topic:3d","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creat